# Whitelist: only each week's code/ folder, plus the site's landing page and config, is tracked.
# Readings, slides, the syllabus and local tool settings stay out of the repo.
/*
!/.gitignore
!/.vercelignore
!/README.md
!/index.html
!/vercel.json
!/week-*/
/week-*/*
!/week-*/code/

__pycache__/
*.pyc
.DS_Store
.vercel
